  "distributionChanges": [
    "Runtime configuration may enable only the bundled Codex adapter; optional providers are not advertised without configuration.",
    "Codex pool tasks freeze saved and derived effective execution preferences for standard, sol_luna, and luna_direct; any child-enabled custom slot requires a fresh CLI-and-role-bound local capability report and a task-private next_preset_worker role copy.",
    "Windows desktop bridge optionally reads its real workflow preferences again at create, approval and final spawn; disabled/closed/changed frozen model settings fail closed. Existing Mac configurations omit this adapter."
  ],
